⚡ Renewable Energy RAG Bot

A Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) based AI chatbot that explains renewable energy concepts, plant operations, and safety procedures using a structured knowledge base.

The application combines vector similarity search with large language model reasoning to generate accurate and context-aware responses.

This project demonstrates how modern AI systems combine LLMs, embeddings, and vector databases to build intelligent assistants.

🚀 Features

• AI chatbot for renewable energy concepts
• Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline
• Vector similarity search using ChromaDB
• Local embeddings using Sentence Transformers
• Response generation using Gemini 2.5 Flash
• Interactive Streamlit web interface
• Knowledge base covering:

Renewable energy fundamentals

Solar photovoltaic systems

Wind turbine technology

Electrical grid integration

Renewable energy plant safety

🧠 System Architecture

The application follows a Retrieval-Augmented Generation architecture.

User Question
      │
      ▼
Embedding Model
(Sentence Transformers)
      │
      ▼
Vector Database
(ChromaDB)
      │
Retrieve Relevant Knowledge
      │
      ▼
Prompt Construction
(System Prompt + Context)
      │
      ▼
Gemini 2.5 Flash
(LLM Response Generation)
      │
      ▼
Streamlit Interface
(Display AI Explanation)

This architecture ensures the model produces grounded answers based on the knowledge base.

🛠 Tech Stack
Component	Technology
Programming Language	Python
Web Interface	Streamlit
LLM	Gemini 2.5 Flash
Vector Database	ChromaDB
Embeddings	Sentence Transformers
AI Method	Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
