⚙️ Installation

Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/saitharun-student-27/Renewable-Energy-RAG-Bot.git
cd Renewable-Energy-RAG-Bot

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt
▶️ Running the Application

Start the Streamlit app:

streamlit run app.py

The application will launch in your browser:

http://localhost:8501
🔑 API Key Setup

This project uses Gemini LLM for response generation.

You can obtain a free API key from:

https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey

Enter the API key in the Streamlit sidebar when running the application.

💬 Example Questions

Try asking:

What is renewable energy?
What are the types of renewable energy?
How does a solar power plant work?
What are the main components of a wind turbine?
What safety practices are used in renewable plants?
📚 Knowledge Base Coverage

The chatbot retrieves information about:

• Renewable energy fundamentals
• Solar photovoltaic technology
• Wind turbine systems
• Electrical grid infrastructure
• Safety procedures in energy plants

This ensures responses are context-aware and educational.

